splat lit: wrong number of arguments (given 0, expected 1; required keyword: k1)
splat var: wrong number of arguments (given 0, expected 1; required keyword: k1)
splat mid: wrong number of arguments (given 2, expected 1; required keyword: k1)
gather: wrong number of arguments (given 3, expected 1..2; required keywords: k, j)
lambda: wrong number of arguments (given 1, expected 0; required keyword: k1)
lambda rest: wrong number of arguments (given 0, expected 1+; required keyword: k)
poly arm: wrong number of arguments (given 0, expected 1; required keyword: k)
poly none: wrong number of arguments (given 0, expected 1..2; required keywords: k, j)
poly splat: wrong number of arguments (given 3, expected 1; required keyword: k)
missing: missing keywords: :k, :j
missing one: missing keyword: :j
unknown: unknown keywords: :z, :y
unknown str: unknown keywords: "s", :z
unknown quoted: unknown keywords: :"a b", :z
dispatch: missing keywords: :k, :j
proc: missing keywords: :k, :j
kw splat: unknown keywords: :z, :y
class value: missing keywords: :k, :j
data super: missing keywords: :b, :c
data with: unknown keywords: :z, :y, "s"
nokw boxed: no keywords accepted
nokw literal: no keywords accepted
nokw count: no keywords accepted
nokw empty: ok []
kwinit splat: wrong number of arguments (given 2, expected 0)
kwinit nil: wrong number of arguments (given 1, expected 0)
kwinit mid: wrong number of arguments (given 1, expected 0)
data short: missing keyword: :k1
data empty: missing keyword: :k1
data kw: unknown keyword: :z
data str: unknown keyword: "s"
data dup: unknown keyword: :y
data empty kw: missing keyword: :k1
data mixed: wrong number of arguments (given 2, expected 0)
data long: wrong number of arguments (given 3, expected 0..2)
data none: wrong number of arguments (given 1, expected 0)
data builds: ok #<data D2 a=1, b=2>
data builds str: ok #<data D2 a=1, b=2>
data builds pos: ok #<data D2 a=1, b=2>
data by name: ok #<data D1 k1=1>
